%% The production vertical slice as implemented (services/enterprise-api/src/domain). Every call is authenticated; every write is one
%% transaction with row-level security, an audit row and outbox events. Proven end to end by tests/integration/api.test.mjs (slices 1–9).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Designer
  actor S as Systems engineer
  actor C as Commissioning engineer
  actor M as Service manager
  actor Q as QA reviewer
  participant API as enterprise-api
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant OS as Object storage
  participant W as Outbox worker
  D->>API: POST /v1/rooms (template)
  API->>DB: room + template devices + revision 1 + classification, checks, applicability (engines) + plan rows + LOCATED_IN / PLANS_DEVICE edges
  D->>API: POST /v1/rooms/{room}/devices
  API->>DB: asset PA-nnnn (tenant-unique) + edge; checks re-run; plan recompiled only if its signature changed
  D->>API: POST /v1/rooms/{room}/revisions
  API->>DB: immutable revision (snapshot + SHA-256)
  S->>API: drawings/generate · drawings/{kind}/approve · classification/approve
  API->>DB: drawing revisions keyed by input hash (REVIEW_REQUIRED when the input changes)
  S->>API: POST /v1/rooms/{room}/lifecycle — each step by its own authority, up to COMMISSIONING
  C->>API: POST /v1/evidence (file)
  API->>OS: put, content-addressed by SHA-256, retained 7 years
  C->>API: POST /v1/rooms/{room}/results (FAIL)
  API->>DB: result + one commissioning deficiency (issue) + AFFECTS edge
  M->>API: POST /v1/issues/{issue}/work-orders, then /v1/work-orders/{wo}/close
  Note over API,DB: closing a work order never passes the test
  C->>API: POST /v1/rooms/{room}/results (PASS)
  API-->>C: PASS_UNVERIFIED
  Q->>API: POST /v1/rooms/{room}/results/{test}/verify (a different person)
  API->>DB: PASS_VERIFIED; the deficiency resolves
  W->>DB: outbox → room_read_model (live health NOT_MONITORED) + notifications
  Q->>API: GET /v1/read/rooms/{room}
